{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03952","headline":"奉和圣制立春日侍宴内殿出剪彩花应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和圣制立春日侍宴内殿出剪彩花应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上林宫馆好，春光独早知。\n剪花疑始发，刻燕似新窥。\n色浓轻雪点，香浅嫩风吹。\n此日叨陪侍，恩荣得数枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}